        },
        "hoops": {
          "type": "content_section",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "2. Gold Hoops — The One You Never Take Off",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_size": 36,
            "subheading": "EVERYDAY ESSENTIAL",
            "subheading_text_color": "#8b7d4a",
            "subheading_background": "#f5f2eb",
            "rich_text": "<p>Every woman needs a pair of gold hoops she can put on without thinking. Not the delicate huggie that disappears, not the oversized statement hoop — the medium-weight hoop in solid 14K gold that sits just below the earlobe and goes with everything. This is the piece that earns its place by being the answer to 'what earrings should I wear?' every single morning.</p><p>Why solid gold and not gold-filled or plated? Because gold-filled tarnishes with prolonged skin contact, and plating wears off at the highest-friction points first. A pair of solid 14K gold hoops, worn daily and stored properly, will look the same in 2040 as they do today. That is the entire case for spending the extra money once.</p><p>The 3mm Polished Hoop Earrings in 14K gold are the classic everyday version — the right weight, the right diameter, the right finish. For those who want more presence without tipping into statement territory, the 3mm x 40mm Polished Hoops make an impact without trying.</p>",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/TM001746-7.jpg",
            "products_heading": "Featured pieces:",
            "product_list": [
              "3mm-polished-hoop-earrings",
              "3mm-x-40mm-polished-hoop-earrings",
              "3mm-x-30mm-polished-hoop-earrings"
            ],
            "accent_text": "",
            "accent_text_color": "",
            "button_label": "",
