            "button_style": "primary"
          }
        },
        "necklace": {
          "type": "content_section",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "3. A Diamond Necklace — Your Everyday Sparkle",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_size": 36,
            "subheading": "THE PIECE YOU FORGET YOU'RE WEARING ",
            "subheading_text_color": "#8b7d4a",
            "subheading_background": "#f5f2eb",
            "rich_text": "<p>The essential jewelry necklace for your 30s is not a pendant that needs an occasion. It's a necklace you put on in the morning and forget about — until someone asks about it. Fine, delicate, present without demanding attention. The kind that photographs well without looking like it was chosen for photographs.</p><p>A diamond station necklace — diamonds spaced at intervals along a fine gold chain — is the most versatile version. It works at every neckline, reads as elegant at any occasion, and layers well with other pieces if you ever choose to. A tennis necklace is the step up: continuous diamonds around a fine chain, more presence, still effortless.</p><p>The <a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/products/bezel-set-lab-diamond-station-necklace\">Diamond Station Necklace</a> is the piece you'll still be reaching for at 50 — understated, permanently relevant, and at home in every context. For those who want continuous sparkle and are ready to commit to a lifetime piece, the <a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/products/lab-diamond-classic-tennis-necklace\">Lab Diamond Classic Tennis Necklace</a> is the investment version.</p>",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/KN-821-W1.jpg",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/993J5FGNKWG_SGTVEW_ENLRES.jpg",
            "products_heading": "Featured pieces:",
            "product_list": [
              "diamond-station-necklace",
              "lab-diamond-classic-tennis-necklace"
            ],
            "accent_text": "",
