        "band": {
          "type": "content_section",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "5. A Diamond Band Ring — The Adult Right-Hand Ring",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_size": 36,
            "subheading": "QUIET CONFIDENCE PIECE ",
            "subheading_text_color": "#8b7d4a",
            "subheading_background": "#f5f2eb",
            "rich_text": "<p>The right-hand diamond band is the piece that separates fine jewelry from fashion jewelry more clearly than anything else. Worn on the index or middle finger of the right hand, it requires no explanation and no occasion. It simply exists as part of how you present yourself — intentional, understated, and permanent.</p><p>This is the adult upgrade from the fashion rings of your twenties: a slim diamond band in solid gold that looks as at home in a boardroom as it does at a dinner party. The key is restraint — one ring, one hand, no stacking required. The band does the work.</p><p>The <a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/products/minimalist-belima-diamond-ring\">Minimalist Belima Diamond Ring</a> is precisely this: clean, architectural, effortless. The kind of ring you'll still be wearing at 60 without a second thought. For slightly more presence, the<a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/products/diamond-dainty-wedding-band-in-14k-white-gold?pr_prod_strat=e5_desc&pr_rec_id=64934ca47&pr_rec_pid=6625856094341&pr_ref_pid=6625856127109&pr_seq=uniform\"> Diamond Dainty Band</a> worn as a right-hand ring is quietly perfect — the piece you reach for when one ring needs to carry an outfit.</p>",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/KR-6905-Y1.jpg",
            "image_2": "shopify://shop_images/KR6915.jpg",
            "products_heading": "Featured pieces:",
            "product_list": [
              "minimalist-belima-diamond-ring",
              "diamond-dainty-wedding-band-in-14k-white-gold"
