        "gemstone": {
          "type": "content_section",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "6. One Piece That's Entirely Yours",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_size": 36,
            "subheading": "YOUR SIGNATURE PIECE ",
            "subheading_text_color": "#8b7d4a",
            "subheading_background": "#f5f2eb",
            "rich_text": "<p>Five of these six pieces are universal. This one is personal. Every fine jewelry collection needs one piece that isn't a rule — it's a personality. A color that means something to you. A stone that makes you feel like yourself the moment you put it on.</p><p>For some women it's a sapphire ring in the deep blue of a piece their grandmother wore. For others it's a ruby pendant that adds warmth to everything. For others still it's an emerald that references the Carolyn Bessette engagement ring they've always loved. The specifics are yours — the principle is that this piece should feel like it couldn't belong to anyone else.</p><p>Browse our <a href=\"https://www.milanojewelry.com/collections/gemstone-jewelry?sort=price-descending\">gemstone collection</a> for the piece that already exists, or work with us to create something that never has. A custom piece built around a stone and a story is the definition of investment jewelry — and the kind of thing you're still explaining to people thirty years from now.</p><p> </p>",
            "image_1": "shopify://shop_images/KR-8456-W1.jpg",
            "products_heading": "Featured pieces:",
            "product_list": [
              "bezel-art-deco-sapphire-and-diamond-ring"
            ],
            "accent_text": "",
